See text for the explanation of “Mean Global” and
“Global”.
“Language”, “AgentView”, “Eye-in-hand”, and “State” use the corresponding modality-specific latent feature as the task reference. The smallest cosine distance is highlighted in <span id="A2.T10.8.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">bold</span>, and the second smallest is <span id="A2.T10.8.4" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">underlined</span>.
</span></figcaption>
